_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 20
---
order: 20
---
short_label: V.20
---
statement: If there are three magnitudes, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two are in the same ratio, and if <i>ex aequali</i> the first is greater than the third, then the fourth is also greater than the sixth; if equal, equal, and; if less, less.
---
proof:

---
body:

